                                               \n{1153854583685959}\nShiesty is a free-to-play open-world crime sandbox in VR where there are no rules. Steal cars, rob stores, and climb the criminal underworld with your friends. Just watch out for the cops!\n{1113456481541042}\n\n**Key Features**:\n- \ud83d\udcb0 **Rob Anything & Anyone**: Hold up stores, lockpick registers, and point your weapon at any NPC to make them cough up the goods.\n- \ud83d\ude97 **Steal & Customize**: Collect every car and gun in Hustle Rock, then customize them your way.\n- \ud83d\udea8 **Wanted Stars**: The more chaos you cause, the harder the police come after you.\n- \ud83d\udc51 **Rise Through the Ranks**: Fence your loot at the pawn shop, then pay the Don what you owe to level up.\n- \ud83d\udcf1 **Play with Friends**: Call any player directly on your in-game phone, complete with a mini map.\n- \ud83e\ude9d **Move Your Way**: Climb, drive, zip line, and grapple your way across the city.\n\n**Ready to get Shiesty?**", "short_description": "Shiesty is a free-to-play open-world crime sandbox in VR where there are no rules. Steal cars, rob stores, and climb the criminal underworld with your friends. Just watch out for the cops!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://curlyblue.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://curlyblue.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "CurlyBlue LTD.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://curlyblue.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor":